{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-01/1060263/block/singleImage/3248273/wm/01KFXDBYYJG142F9CPZ5APSJ0Y.jpg?updatedAt=1792989841\"/><figcaption>錦綉花園發生爆竊案(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>元朗發生爆竊案。周日（25日）晚上11時許，警方接獲一名68歲姓侯女戶主報案，指發現位於錦綉花園松濤南路的住所有一扇門被撬開，屋内有搜掠痕跡，懷疑上址遭爆竊。 人員接報到場，經初步點算，相信上址有共值約34.9萬元的財物不見了，當中包括兩隻手錶、兩粒金粒、兩條頸鍊、現金港幣及現金外幣。 經初步調查，案件列爆竊，交由元朗警區刑事調查隊第八隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:40:47.198849+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T02:31:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T07:18:18.126117+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:38:05.713382+00:00","content_hash":"3b49e5b6d79eb5aff4ae6f33ca11c4bd89150265b14f1d48d584135e177edba3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:40:47.198849+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}